Possibly from {{etyl|non|ang}} {{m|non|til}}<ref>{{R:Online Etymology Dictionary|till}}</ref> though the OED has it as "Germanic" and related to {{etyl|non|-}} and to {{cog|ofs|til}}<ref>{{R:OED|till}}</ref> <!--http://oxforddictionaries.com/definition/till-->

